From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheKit <thekit@disroot.org>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:52:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] inputflinger: deliver injected touch to an application token

An injection can name the application token it is meant for. Touch then
only hits that application's windows, plus the keyboard and system dialog
windows shown over it, and skips Android's focus and occlusion checks.

Ported from Droidloom.

Change-Id: I61ce8d050b2d337492de41f3008a8878f5e69895
